{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And you shall make an altar for burning incense.</b> It is not mentioned until after the altar of burnt offering, because it intends to say: you shall not offer on it a burnt offering or a meal offering or a libation. And Moses mentioned it to Israel after the Menorah, and likewise in the account of its construction, because it intends to say: when he tends the lamps he shall burn it, and it says, 'and when Aaron sets up the lamps between the evenings he shall burn it.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:08.353521864Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}